BT /F1 10 Tf 72.00 496.00 Td (- schematic organization,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72.00 479.00 Td (- BOM creation,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72.00 462.00 Td (- ERC checking,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72.00 445.00 Td (- test point planning,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72.00 428.00 Td (- awareness of real-world limitations,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72.00 411.00 Td (- ability to communicate an engineering design.) Tj ET
