46 0 obj
<< /Length 2857 >>
stream
BT /F2 8 Tf 54.00 814.00 Td (Complete Report and Interview Q&A) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 532.20 24.00 Td (22) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 772.00 Td (needed, and probe close to the capacitor.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 749.00 Td (85. Why is probing technique important?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 725.00 Td (A long probe ground lead adds inductance and can show false ringing/noise.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 702.00 Td (86. What is a power-good signal?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 678.00 Td (Power-good indicates that a regulator output is within a valid range. It can be used to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 664.00 Td (enable the next rail.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 641.00 Td (87. Why is power-good chaining better than fixed RC delay?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 617.00 Td (It waits for the previous rail to actually be valid instead of only waiting a fixed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 603.00 Td (time.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 580.00 Td (88. What is UVLO?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 556.00 Td (UVLO means undervoltage lockout. It prevents operation when input voltage is too low.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 533.00 Td (89. What is current limit?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 509.00 Td (Current limit protects the regulator and load by limiting output current during overload) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 495.00 Td (or short circuit.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 472.00 Td (90. What is thermal shutdown?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 448.00 Td (Thermal shutdown turns off or limits a device when it gets too hot.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54.00 417.00 Td (KiCad, Documentation, And Workflow) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 388.00 Td (91. Why did you use KiCad?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 364.00 Td (KiCad is a standard open-source EDA tool for schematic capture and PCB design.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 341.00 Td (92. Why did you make custom symbols?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 317.00 Td (Custom local symbols avoid missing-library problems and keep the schematic portable.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 294.00 Td (93. What does the KiCad ERC prove?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 270.00 Td (It proves there are no detected schematic electrical-rule violations in the current) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 256.00 Td (schematic representation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 233.00 Td (94. Does ERC prove the circuit will work?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 209.00 Td (No. ERC catches schematic consistency issues, not full electrical performance or layout) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 195.00 Td (correctness.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 172.00 Td (95. Why export a schematic PDF?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 148.00 Td (A PDF is easy to review, share, and attach to reports or interview portfolios.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 125.00 Td (96. Why include a BOM?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 101.00 Td (A BOM shows part choices, reference designators, functions, packages, and project) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 87.00 Td (organization.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
