stream
BT /F2 8 Tf 54.00 814.00 Td (Complete Report and Interview Q&A) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 532.20 24.00 Td (23) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 772.00 Td (97. What makes a schematic visually good?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 748.00 Td (Clear left-to-right flow, readable labels, grouped functions, minimal wire crossings,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 734.00 Td (proper net names, and uncluttered notes.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 711.00 Td (98. What was cleaned in the LTspice schematic?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 687.00 Td (Long formulas were moved into `.func` directives, duplicated labels were removed, rails) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 673.00 Td (were spaced out, and directives were grouped separately.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 650.00 Td (99. What was cleaned in the KiCad schematic?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 626.00 Td (Symbols were made more recognizable, labels were spaced away from pins, the sheet size) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 612.00 Td (was increased, and ERC was kept clean.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 589.00 Td (100. Why is documentation important?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 565.00 Td (Documentation proves that the designer understands the design, not just that files) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 551.00 Td (exist.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54.00 520.00 Td (Deep Interview Questions) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 491.00 Td (101. If the final loads are 500 mA, 600 mA, and 800 mA, what is your biggest) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 476.00 Td (concern?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 452.00 Td (The biggest concern is regulator current and thermal rating. The guide-selected parts) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 438.00 Td (must be verified or replaced with parts that can safely supply those currents.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 415.00 Td (102. Would you fabricate this exact board?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 391.00 Td (Not without final regulator selection, datasheet component values, footprint) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 377.00 Td (verification, thermal checks, and PCB layout review.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 354.00 Td (103. What would you say if an interviewer points out the regulator current) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 339.00 Td (mismatch?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 315.00 Td (I would say that is a valid catch. In this project the parts were guide/model) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 301.00 Td (references, and the report explicitly notes that production parts must be current-rated.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 287.00 Td (That shows I understand the difference between a learning schematic and a fabrication-) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 273.00 Td (ready design.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 250.00 Td (104. How would you choose final regulators?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 226.00 Td (I would define input range, output voltage, max current, ripple limit, efficiency) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 212.00 Td (target, package constraints, thermal environment, cost, availability, and then compare) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 198.00 Td (datasheet-recommended application circuits.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 175.00 Td (105. How much current margin would you prefer?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 151.00 Td (I would usually choose a regulator with comfortable margin above expected maximum) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 137.00 Td (current, depending on thermal conditions and transient requirements.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 114.00 Td (106. What thermal checks would you run?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 90.00 Td (Estimate power loss, junction temperature rise, package thermal resistance, copper area,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 76.00 Td (airflow, and worst-case ambient temperature.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
