BT /F2 8 Tf 54.00 814.00 Td (Complete Report and Interview Q&A) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 532.20 24.00 Td (25) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 772.00 Td (118. What would make this project stronger?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 748.00 Td (A routed PCB, regulator replacement with current-rated parts, detailed ripple) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 734.00 Td (simulation, real bench measurements, and thermal images would make it stronger.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 711.00 Td (119. What did you learn from the project?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 687.00 Td (I learned how to organize a power tree, plan sequencing, build a readable LTspice) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 673.00 Td (simulation, clean a KiCad schematic, and document engineering limitations honestly.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54.00 650.00 Td (120. Give the final 30-second pitch.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 626.00 Td (This is a multi-rail power board for an SoC and sensor cluster. It takes 5 V and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 612.00 Td (generates 1.2 V, 1.8 V, and 3.3 V rails with controlled startup sequencing. I simulated) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 598.00 Td (the startup and sensor-load transient in LTspice, created an ERC-clean KiCad schematic) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 584.00 Td (with protection, output capacitors, load elements, enable networks, and test points, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 570.00 Td (documented the design with BOM, reports, plots, and interview Q&A. The project) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 556.00 Td (demonstrates architecture-level power design and a realistic hardware workflow, while) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54.00 542.00 Td (clearly identifying what must be upgraded before fabrication.) Tj ET
endstream
